note: |
  Fires when duplicated code is folded into a single canonical home —
  lift then delete (concepts/frag-dedup-is-lift-then-delete.md). The
  tell is a verbatim or shape-for-shape twin retiring into a shared
  import, usually surfaced by the deslop census's sampled roll.

  Witnessed 2026-10-23: emitter_helpers' private containsToken had a
  verbatim port (`containsTokenLocal`) in continuation_codegen;
  canonical home is codegen_utils, the leaf both modules already
  import — six call sites retargeted, census back under pin.
route: surface
